            "title": "Who We Are"
          }
        },
        "text_Y9EFhC": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>T Squared Putters was founded with one purpose in mind to build putters for golfers who understand that putting is not just a stroke but a confidence builder.</p><p>We design and manufacture state of the art golf putters for players who value feel, speed, balance, and consistency on the greens. Whether you are a weekend golfer or a competitive player, our goal is simple to create putters that fit naturally in your hands and perform under pressure when it matters most.</p><p>Rather than following trends, we focus on building putters that allow golfers to putt with confidence round after round.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
