        "image": "shopify://shop_images/713i_Face_Lander.png",
        "image_mask": "none",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "Our Story",
        "text": "<p>T Squared Putters was founded by brothers Tony and Mike Tuber Jr in Orchard Park New York inside a family owned dental and medical machine shop equipped with high precision CNC mills.<br/><br/>What started as access to advanced machining quickly turned into an opportunity. Tony, an avid golfer, wanted a Circle T style putter but understood that level of craftsmanship came at a premium. When one of the shop’s engineers suggested machining one in<br/>house, the idea became reality. That first putter sparked what would become T Squared Putters.<br/><br/>Mike, involved from the beginning, recognized the potential to take the concept beyond a single build. Together, he and Tony brought the brand to market combining engineering level precision with a golfer’s demand for feel, balance, and performance.</p><p>Like many golfers, we were frustrated by the inconsistency and lack of refinement found in mass produced equipment. We believed golfers deserved better. From that belief came our commitment to designing and manufacturing custom golf putters centered on performance, accuracy, and trust starting with exceptional design because the best putters always do.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "50",
        "layout": "left",
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_DJrYRU": {
      "type": "text-and-image",
      "name": "t:sections.text-and-image.presets.image_with_text.name",
      "settings": {
        "image": "shopify://shop_images/461560968_18000049853663614_1633040629894449766_n.jpg",
        "image_mask": "none",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "<p>Built Not Bent Technology</p>",
        "text": "<p>At the core of every T Squared putter is our patented Built Not Bent technology.</p><p>Every putter is built to the golfer’s exact specifications from the start. We do not heat or bend putters after machining. These methods can introduce stress, compromise structural integrity, and diminish long-term consistency.<br/><br/>Instead, lie angle, loft, balance, and configuration are achieved through precision machining and component based engineering. The result is a putter that maintains its integrity while delivering consistent performance and feel round after round.</p>",
        "button_label": "",
        "button_link": "",
        "button_style": "primary",
        "align_text": "left",
        "image_width": "50",
        "layout": "right",
        "divider": false,
        "top_padding": true,
        "bottom_padding": true,
        "lazyload_images": true
      }
    },
    "text_and_image_J4ibEa": {
