        "image_mask": "none",
        "image2_mask": "none",
        "subtitle": "",
        "title": "<p>Craftsmanship You Can Feel</p>",
        "text": "<p>Quality should not just be seen. It should be felt.</p><p>Every T Squared putter is fully milled and assembled in Orchard Park New York inside our family owned machine shop. Each putter is produced using a precision CNC machining process and inspected by hand to ensure it meets our exacting standards.</p><p>We are proud to be a <a href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"/\">Golf Putters Made in USA</a> brand that values craftsmanship over volume. We do not rush production. We do not cut corners. Every putter that leaves our building reflects meticulous attention to detail, consistent balance, and long term durability.<br/><br/>We take pride in every putter we build because our name is on every one.</p>",
