        "title": "<p>Why Choose </p><p>T Squared Putters</p>",
        "text": "<ul><li>Precision crafted <a href=\"/collections/custom-putters\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Custom Putters\">custom golf putters</a> built to exact specifications</li><li>Fully milled and assembled in Orchard Park New York</li><li>Patented Built Not Bent technology with no heat or bending</li><li>Balanced designs focused on feel control and consistency</li><li>Family owned golf putter manufacturer</li><li>Proudly Golf Putters Made in USA</li><li>Built for golfers who care about performance not mass production</li></ul>",
